INSERT INTO `brand_profiles` VALUES (1,'NailIt','Luxury DIY nail fashion e-commerce',NULL,'NailIt is an online nail-fashion shop for elevated press-on nails and a disposable self-service manicure mannequin kit. Customers choose a set, use the guided at-home fitting system, and create a polished manicure moment on their own schedule.','Polished, feminine, fashion-editorial and quietly confident. Speak like a luxury beauty stylist: concise, sensory and aspirational. Celebrate personal ritual, detail and self-expression without sounding childish, overly technical or pushy.','Luxury-minded, style-led women and femme-presenting shoppers, primarily 18 to 35, who enjoy beauty rituals, curated aesthetics, occasion dressing and premium self-care. They value a salon-polished look, convenience, gifting and content-worthy details.','[{\"name\": \"NailIt Signature Press-On Sets\", \"price\": null, \"benefits\": \"A polished nail-fashion look, easy personal styling and a considered beauty ritual at home.\", \"description\": \"Curated premium press-on nail sets designed for an elevated at-home manicure look. Position each set through finish, colour story, occasion and styling mood.\"}, {\"name\": \"NailIt Mannequin Kit\", \"price\": null, \"benefits\": \"A guided, self-directed application experience that makes the at-home nail ritual feel more considered.\", \"description\": \"A disposable self-service manicure mannequin and guided fitting kit for customers applying their chosen NailIt set themselves. Describe it as an at-home application companion and styling tool.\"}]','Luxury-inspired nail fashion for at-home self-expression. Curated press-on nail sets. A disposable self-service manicure mannequin kit to support an at-home application ritual. Suitable for gifting, occasion styling and personal beauty rituals.','Do not make medical, dermatological, safety, allergy-free, damage-free, salon-equivalent, professional-grade, long-wear or instant-application claims unless specifically substantiated. Do not imply the mannequin kit is reusable. Do not promise a precise wear duration. Avoid shaming natural nails, salons or other beauty routines.','2026-08-28 08:44:21','2026-08-28 08:44:21');
