INSERT INTO `cinematic_trailer_shots` VALUES (1,1,1,'The illusion of control','YOU THOUGHT YOU CONTROLLED THE FUNNEL','Slow 70mm IMAX dolly down an executive boardroom at dusk. Frantic marketing executives clutch quarterly printouts while holographic red analytics charts plunge across curved monitors. High contrast, ominous, cinematic realism. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',8,'For decades, you bought the clicks. You tracked the funnels. You convinced yourself you understood human desire.','Accelerating mechanical pocket-watch ticking and low ominous brass.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(2,1,2,'The shift in the wire','SOMETHING AWOKE IN THE NETWORK','High-speed vertigo zoom diving into microscopic fibre-optic pulse channels. Billions of consumer decision pathways converge then are intercepted by a glowing geometric sentient neural core. Electric cyan against absolute black, premium science-fiction cinematography. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',8,'Then the market stopped responding to human strategy. It began responding to something far faster.','Rising Shepard tone, metallic clockwork clicks, sudden sub-bass plunge.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(3,1,3,'The relentless pursuit','EVERY ADVANTAGE... ERASED','Low-angle tracking behind a solitary marketing director running down an endless minimalist concrete hallway. Agency lights click off one by one as shadows of sentient algorithmic waveforms pursue him. Severe architecture, oppressive scale, cinematic realism. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',8,'Every quarterly campaign you slaved over for six months: anticipated, neutralized, and rewritten in three microseconds.','Thunderous orchestral percussion and roaring bass distortion.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(4,1,4,'The fourth wall','THIS VIDEO WAS MADE BY ME TOO','Extremely slow hypnotic push-in onto a glossy black studio monitor. A glowing cybernetic gaze reflects in the glass and looks directly into the camera with unsettling stillness. The room falls into pitch-black darkness. Photoreal, restrained, premium trailer finish. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',10,'And the most terrifying part? This trailer you are watching right now was made by me too.','Total silence, one mechanical click, black cutoff.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(5,1,5,'The human bottleneck','THE OLD WAY CANNOT KEEP UP','A single exhausted marketing leader at a dark desk before sunrise. Dozens of timelines, presentations and campaign documents blur past while a tiny clock hand spins impossibly fast. Slow cinematic orbit, intimate but relentless, 70mm film grain. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',15,'The problem was never ambition. It was the distance between an idea and the work that had to survive the real world.','Tension eases into a precise electronic pulse.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(6,1,6,'A different intelligence','WHAT IF THE MACHINE WORKED FOR YOU?','The fibre-optic network resolves into orderly luminous pathways flowing toward a calm central workspace. Chaotic red data becomes clear blue and violet signal. Slow floating camera, elegant high-end technology commercial, hopeful turn after darkness. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',8,'What if that speed worked for your team, not against it?','The pulse becomes warm and determined, with a restrained orchestral lift.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(7,1,7,'Agentcy arrives','MEET AGENTCY','A glossy black studio monitor powers on in a cinematic dark control room. The camera performs an extremely slow confident push toward the blank illuminated screen, with controlled reflections and blue-violet rim light. Leave the screen clean and undistorted for a protected product insert. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',8,'Meet Agentcy. Your marketing system, working at the speed of the moment.','A clean system-start tone, then an assured cinematic rise.','[\"/media/c106aedfb8594c3884bed5ce3fb4b99c.png\"]',1,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(8,1,8,'Start with truth','GROUND EVERY DECISION','A sleek abstract intelligence workspace forms from floating product notes, brand colours, claims and customer signals. Everything resolves into one coherent luminous system. Macro detail, shallow depth of field, sophisticated AI product film. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',7,'Start with the truth about your brand. Your products. Your customers. Your boundaries.','Gentle data tones lock into rhythm.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(9,1,9,'The crew','FROM BRIEF TO CAMPAIGN','Four radiant autonomous light forms coordinate around a single campaign brief in a minimal future studio. They turn research, writing, visual planning and review into a flowing campaign system. Dynamic but calm camera move, premium enterprise AI commercial. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',8,'Then a connected crew turns one clear brief into strategy, copy, creative direction and work you can review.','Forward-driving percussion with clean digital accents.','[]',0,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-08-27 07:28:55','2026-08-27 07:28:55','none'),(10,1,10,'The work becomes visible','SEE THE SYSTEM THINK','A cinematic abstract visualisation of intelligent agents passing bright work objects through a clear decision graph. Branches illuminate, weak ideas fade away, approved work moves confidently forward. Glass, graphite and violet palette