studio'),(37,3,9,'Video Studio in motion','SCRIPT TO CINEMATIC CUT','Use the exact referenced Agentcy Video Studio screen as the source of a seamless cinematic production line. Script and storyboard panels evolve into AI clip cards, then converge toward a composed master while the real interface remains recognisable on a moving studio screen. Elegant depth, realistic reflections, no pasted screenshot, slideshow, generic editor, added captions, logos or watermarks.','reference_to_video',8,'Write the story. Generate the clips. Compose the cut. Regenerate any take without rewriting the script.','The score gathers momentum with sleek electronic motion and deep cinematic drums.','[\"/media/a0116727200d49e694a8e48ff90c93b3.png\"]',0,'df6bcf27-e646-45cc-9af0-c1576c7dbf6d','succeeded',NULL,'/media/e3234a5e6200443bb2b864990d429f84.mp4','2026-08-28 15:24:43','2026-08-28 15:33:21','studio'),(38,3,10,'Progress stays visible','LEAVE. RETURN. KNOW.','Use the exact referenced Agentcy Progress screen in a living cinematic workstation. Active work, stage markers and next actions glow with calm clarity as the camera tracks past the real interface. The product screen is part of the room, never a copied dashboard or slideshow. Premium dark technology commercial, no added captions, logos or watermarks.','reference_to_video',6,'Work can continue in the background. You always know what is running, waiting or ready.','A steady reassuring pulse, subtle high strings and quiet kinetic clicks.','[\"/media/55185c1d9d4442dfad8e495897ca123f.png\"]',0,'0c0165e0-88a9-410d-b545-d29c96614958','succeeded',NULL,'/media/3bf838877b6a4005b063cf77eee4198c.mp4','2026-08-28 15:24:43','2026-08-28 15:33:31','history'),(39,3,11,'The human review gate','YOU KEEP THE DECISION','The exact referenced Agentcy creative-review screen becomes a cinematic human decision moment. A human hand approaches an approval control that grows naturally from the real interface; algorithmic light waits at a respectful distance. Slow, confident camera, truthful UI projection, no pasted screenshot, slideshow, added captions, logos or watermarks.','reference_to_video',7,'The system moves fast. It still stops where your judgement matters.','Music opens into a confident, spacious held chord; the beat briefly breathes.','[\"/media/a0116727200d49e694a8e48ff90c93b3.png\"]',0,'628f51ab-8409-4002-8cd4-25447dd069c6','succeeded',NULL,'/media/b998d3e2800649689c08ba1e2031ea50.mp4','2026-08-28 15:24:43','2026-08-28 15:35:31','studio'),(40,3,12,'Publish for every channel','READY FOR THE REAL WORLD','Use the exact referenced Agentcy Publish screen as a cinematic distribution surface. The real social previews, channel formats and post copy flow into elegant living panels around a monitor, then resolve back to the verified interface. Stylish, product-led, no generic social app, pasted screenshot, slideshow, added captions, logos or watermarks.','reference_to_video',7,'When the work is ready, shape it for every channel with the copy that belongs beside it.','The score expands into a polished, optimistic electronic-orchestral rise.','[\"/media/f2676a9774a64a2e8d8e025fefc4a35c.png\"]',0,'27aa490d-f188-4fc2-9b3b-8c586ab882ab','succeeded',NULL,'/media/6b2d6c950a184571bc435f6dc384671c.mp4','2026-08-28 15:24:43','2026-08-28 15:35:46','hub'),(41,3,13,'The history stays useful','A RECORD, NOT A BLACK BOX','Use the exact referenced Agentcy History screen as a refined cinematic archive. Real campaign records and completed work become glass cards travelling through a precise decision trail, then settle back into the supplied interface. Preserve its dark Agentcy identity, premium dimensional motion, no pasted screenshot, slideshow, billboard, added captions, logos or watermarks.','reference_to_video',8,'Every decision and every outcome remains visible, so the next campaign starts smarter.','A confident resolve with warm synth texture and controlled percussion.','[\"/media/55185c1d9d4442dfad8e495897ca123f.png\"]',0,'a5d38ee3-e541-4291-8bb0-84c5919cada2','succeeded',NULL,'/media/a1e0f9b139744079aa958f2f5fdc5a11.mp4','2026-08-28 15:24:43','2026-08-28 15:37:16','history'),(42,3,14,'The fourth wall','THIS VIDEO WAS MADE BY ME TOO','Extremely slow hypnotic push-in onto a glossy black studio monitor. A glowing cybernetic gaze reflects in the glass and looks directly into the camera with unsettling stillness. The room falls into pitch-black darkness. Photoreal, restrained, premium trailer finish. No text, letters, logos, captions or watermarks.','text_to_video',6,'And the most terrifying part? This trailer you are watching right now was made by me too.','Total silence, one mechanical click, pitch-black cutoff.','[]',0,'27b46877-56da-4625-aa34-7d587140bbfa','succeeded',NULL,'/media/8e8e7bcfb1bd4762b284e94cb5c36c24.mp4','2026-08-28 15:24:43','2026-08-28 15:35:31','none');
