INSERT INTO `concepts` VALUES (1,1,'[demo] The problem your customer already feels','image','[demo] Matches what is running well right now. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e, my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b]','[demo] Sits inside the brand\'s stated position. [sources: campaigns.md#0-ac2fa8295ccb2bba, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',3,'[\"emotional hook\", \"proof shown\", \"cta phrasing\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-25 02:11:37','2026-08-25 02:11:37'),(2,1,'[demo] The bundle, priced for the moment','carousel','[demo] Matches what is running well right now. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e, my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b]','[demo] Sits inside the brand\'s stated position. [sources: campaigns.md#0-ac2fa8295ccb2bba, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',2,'[\"value framing\", \"cta phrasing\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-25 02:11:37','2026-08-25 02:11:37'),(3,1,'[demo] One honest before and after','video','[demo] Matches what is running well right now. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e, my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b]','[demo] Sits inside the brand\'s stated position. [sources: campaigns.md#0-ac2fa8295ccb2bba, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',3,'[\"everyday moment\", \"before and after\", \"cta phrasing\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-25 02:11:37','2026-08-25 02:11:37'),(4,2,'[demo] The problem your customer already feels','image','[demo] Matches what is running well right now. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e, manual_seed.md#5-43e33ed51a2ff6b9]','[demo] Sits inside the brand\'s stated position. [sources: campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936, products.md#1-ff70df38bba8b661]',3,'[\"emotional hook\", \"proof shown\", \"cta phrasing\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-25 04:12:01','2026-08-25 04:12:33'),(5,2,'[demo] The bundle, priced for the moment','carousel','[demo] Matches what is running well right now. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e, manual_seed.md#5-43e33ed51a2ff6b9]','[demo] Sits inside the brand\'s stated position. [sources: campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936, products.md#1-ff70df38bba8b661]',2,'[\"value framing\", \"cta phrasing\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-25 04:12:01','2026-08-25 04:12:31'),(6,2,'[demo] Reworked around your note','image','[demo] Matches what is running well right now. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e, manual_seed.md#5-43e33ed51a2ff6b9]','[demo] Sits inside the brand\'s stated position. [sources: campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936, products.md#1-ff70df38bba8b661]',3,'[\"emotional hook\", \"proof shown\", \"cta phrasing\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-25 04:12:01','2026-08-25 04:12:29'),(7,7,'Raya Gifting, Reimagined as Skincare Self-Care for the KL Office Worker','carousel','Trends show strong interest in \'raya promotion terbaik malaysia\', \'raya promotion online\', and \'raya promotion shopee\' — signalling that KL office workers are actively searching for Raya deals on e-commerce platforms. However, trends are inspiration only; the product must remain Embun skincare, not kopi. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#2-54a366b42771a2b3, my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b]','Embun’s Full Routine bundle (RM249) is explicitly pushed during platform mega-sales, and the brand is JAKIM halal-certified and made in Malaysia — both strong gifting credentials for Raya. The brand voice is warm, plainspoken, and bilingual, which fits a relatable office-worker tone. [sources: brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',3,'[\"gift recipient angle (colleague vs. best friend vs. family member)\", \"platform CTA (Shopee vs. Lazada vs. TikTok Shop)\", \"visual setting (office desk vs. open-plan pantry vs. home office)\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-26 06:04:01','2026-08-26 06:04:01'),(8,7,'The \'Kulit Sihat\' Starter as the Perfect Raya \'Thank You\' Gift for Office Colleagues','video','Trends show high search volume for \'raya promotion murah\' and \'raya promotion review jujur\' — indicating that KL office workers are price-sensitive but want honest recommendations before buying Raya gifts. This aligns with Embun’s price-sensitive but brand-loyal audience. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b, my-skincare-malaysia.md#2-9cd0fba10e097ff4]','The Kulit Sihat starter (cleanser + serum, RM99) is Embun’s main acquisition offer, and sampling sachets are attached free to any order above RM120 — a strong incentive for office workers buying multiple gifts. The brand voice is warm and plainspoken, avoiding clinical or breathless claims. [sources: products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4, brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, campaigns.md#3-b2c3e00cda085e89]',3,'[\"hook (problem-solution vs. unboxing vs. testimonial)\", \"cast (solo office worker vs. duo of colleagues vs. team gift-giving)\", \"proof (before/after skin vs. unboxing reaction vs. colleague thank-you note)\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-26 06:04:01','2026-08-26 06:04:01'),(9,7,'Raya Ready Skin: The Embun Full Routine as the Ultimate \'Self-Gift\' for KL Office Workers','video','Trends show rising interest in \'raya promotion viral tiktok\' and \'shopee live terbaik malaysia\' — indicating that KL office workers are discovering Raya deals through TikTok and Shopee Live. This aligns with Embun’s phone-first, TikTok-discovering audience. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b, my-shopee-live.md#2-89e629a787d7a971]','The Full Routine bundle (all four products, RM249) is pushed only during platform mega-sales, making it a natural fit for a Raya campaign. The brand is formulated for 32°C heat and 80% humidity — a strong selling point for KL office workers commuting in the tropical climate. The brand voice is bilingual and relatable, using natural Manglish and Bahasa Melayu code-switching. [sources: products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4, brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',3,'[\"hook (commuter skin struggle vs. office air-con dryness vs. Raya event prep)\", \"setting (LRT commute vs. office desk vs. home vanity)\", \"CTA (Shopee Live exclusive vs. TikTok Shop bundle vs. Lazada mega-sale)\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-26 06:04:01','2026-08-26 06:04:01'),(10,9,'Raya gift-giving made easy for the office crowd — the Kulit Sihat starter as a thoughtful, no-fuss Raya hamper.','carousel','Rising queries show \'raya promotion shopee\' and \'raya promotion murah\' are top search intents; positioning the RM99 starter as a \'Raya gift set\' on Shopee answers the gifting + promotion-seeking behaviour directly. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b]','The Kulit Sihat starter (cleanser + serum, RM99) is our main acquisition offer; free sampling sachets above RM120 add gifting value. Brand voice is warm, plainspoken, bilingual — perfect for a \'older sister recommending a gift\' angle. [sources: products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4, brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, campaigns.md#3-b2c3e00cda085e89, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',2,'[\"hook\", \"setting\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-26 06:08:04','2026-08-26 06:08:22'),(11,9,'Office Raya prep — surviving the pre-Raya rush with a skincare refresh, positioned as a \'Raya promotion terbaik\' for the KL office worker.','video','\'raya promotion terbaik malaysia\' and \'raya promotion review jujur\' are top/rising queries; a short TikTok-style \'honest review\' from an office worker\'s POV taps into the phone-first discovery behaviour of the core audience. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#2-54a366b42771a2b3, my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b]','Embun is formulated for 32°C heat and 80% humidity — perfect for KL office workers commuting and working in air-con. Brand voice: short sentences, questions, \'you\', bilingual code-switching. [sources: brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, campaigns.md#3-b2c3e00cda085e89, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]',2,'[\"cast\", \"proof\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-26 06:08:04','2026-08-26 06:08:22'),(12,9,'Raya glow-up for the \'balik kampung\' office worker — Embun as the last-minute Raya self-care treat before heading home.','carousel','\'raya promotion viral tiktok\' is the #1 rising query; a TikTok-native \'get ready with me for Raya\' format leverages the phone-first, TikTok-discovery behaviour of the core audience. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b]','Embun is JAKIM halal-certified and NPRA-notified — important for the mixed Malay/Chinese/Indian audience during Raya. The Kulih Sihat starter (RM99) is the main acquisition offer; free sachets above RM120 add value for gifting or personal use. [sources: brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4, campaigns.md#3-b2c3e00cda085e89, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',2,'[\"hook\", \"CTA\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-26 06:08:04','2026-08-26 06:08:04'),(13,10,'The Open House Survival Kit','video','TikTok POV and ‘viral’ Raya content dominate Malaysian social feeds during the festive season, with ‘raya promotion viral tiktok’ as a top rising query. This format lets us showcase the gift set in a relatable, humorous office context. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b, manual_seed.md#0-13da722df8a2258c]','Embun’s brand voice is warm, plainspoken, and a little funny — perfect for a ‘survival kit’ angle. The brand’s bilingual, code-switching style will feel natural in a TikTok POV format targeting young, urban Malaysians. [sources: brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]',3,'[\"hook\", \"cast\", \"setting\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-26 07:54:00','2026-08-26 07:54:00'),(14,10,'The ‘Review Jujur’ Unboxing','video','‘Review jujur’ and ‘shopee live’ are top rising and top queries respectively, indicating strong consumer appetite for authentic, unfiltered product reviews during the festive shopping season. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b, my-shopee-live.md#2-89e629a787d7a971]','Embun’s brand voice is knowledgeable and plainspoken — we can lean into the ‘honest review’ trend without compromising our credibility. The brand’s focus on ‘skin that lives in 32°C heat’ will be a key proof point. [sources: brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]',3,'[\"hook\", \"proof\", \"CTA\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-26 07:54:00','2026-08-26 07:54:00'),(15,10,'The Last-Minute Gift Panic','video','‘Raya promotion berdekatan’ and ‘raya promotion online’ are top queries, indicating that many consumers are looking for last-minute, convenient gifting solutions as Raya approaches. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#2-54a366b42771a2b3, manual_seed.md#0-13da722df8a2258c]','Embun’s brand voice is warm and relatable — we can tap into the ‘panic’ of last-minute gifting with a humorous, empathetic tone. The brand’s bilingual, code-switching style will feel natural in a WhatsApp chat format. [sources: brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]',3,'[\"hook\", \"cast\", \"setting\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-26 07:54:00','2026-08-26 07:54:00'),(16,11,'Private Sale Invitation','carousel','Leveraging the trend of exclusive, members-only experiences and the rising interest in \'review jujur\' (honest reviews) from Raya promotion data, this concept frames the iPhone discount as a curated, insider opportunity that appeals to the desire for authenticity and exclusivity. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b, manual_seed.md#2-a97cf75aebd4d962]','Aligns with the brand\'s positioning of offering premium, dermatologist-reviewed products at accessible price points. The \'Private Sale\' angle mirrors the brand\'s strategy of creating urgency through limited-time offers while maintaining a sophisticated tone. [sources: brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c, campaigns.md#0-ac2fa8295ccb2bba, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]',3,'[\"aesthetic treatment\", \"aesthetic treatment\", \"aesthetic treatment\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-26 08:37:52','2026-08-26 08:38:20'),(17,11,'The Art of the Deal','video','Drawing from the trend of \'smart shopping\' and the rising interest in \'harga\' (price) from Merdeka sale data, this concept positions the discount as a sophisticated choice for discerning buyers who appreciate value without compromising prestige. [sources: my-merdeka-sale.md#1-1d16838a8f2b4335, manual_seed.md#3-9d6e75e77b26a6c8]','Reflects the brand\'s understanding that the target audience is price-sensitive but brand-loyal. The \'Art of the Deal\' concept elevates the discount from a mere price cut to a strategic decision, appealing to the audience\'s desire for both quality and value. [sources: brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c, products.md#0-9acf1c4f15ecbab2, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]',3,'[\"aesthetic treatment\", \"aesthetic treatment\", \"aesthetic treatment\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-26 08:37:52','2026-08-26 08:38:19'),(18,11,'Golden Hour Luxury','carousel','Utilizing the trend of aspirational lifestyle content and the rising interest in \'viral tiktok\' from both Raya and Merdeka promotion data, this concept uses cinematic aesthetics to make the discount feel like a premium reward rather than a bargain. [sources: my-raya-promotion.md#1-8dea3e0ce96a406b, my-merdeka-sale.md#1-1d16838a8f2b4335]','Aligns with the brand\'s strategy of creating visually appealing, high-quality content that resonates with the target audience\'s desire for premium experiences. The \'Golden Hour\' aesthetic elevates the iPhone from a tech product to a lifestyle accessory. [sources: brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c, campaigns.md#0-ac2fa8295ccb2bba, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]',3,'[\"aesthetic treatment\", \"aesthetic treatment\", \"aesthetic treatment\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-26 08:37:52','2026-08-26 08:38:20'),(19,12,'The Humidity-Proof Commute','video','Leverages the \'Climate honesty\' trend and \'Get ready with me, Malaysian humidity edition\' format to build trust through relatability rather than hype. [sources: manual_seed.md#4-d05c13434d930170, manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e]','Directly addresses the brand\'s formulation for 32°C heat and 80% humidity, targeting the core audience of urban professionals who are phone-first and price-sensitive. [sources: products.md#2-1fd832e6cfacf871, brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, campaigns.md#3-b2c3e00cda085e89]',3,'[\"time_of_day_setting\", \"commute_mode\", \"skin_concern_focus\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-27 03:10:05','2026-08-27 03:10:05'),(20,12,'Local Made, Local Logic','carousel','Taps into \'Local-made pride\' which peaks in late August, ensuring the pride is backed by substance (formulated for local weather) rather than just flag-waving. [sources: manual_seed.md#4-d05c13434d930170, my-merdeka-sale.md#2-ca5900870393c683]','Uses the \'knowledgeable older sister\' voice to explain why a Malaysian-made barrier cream works better for Malaysian skin than global brands built for dry winters. [sources: brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334, products.md#2-1fd832e6cfacf871]',3,'[\"comparison_angle\", \"visual_metaphor\", \"cta_urgency\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-27 03:10:05','2026-08-27 03:10:05'),(21,12,'The \'Gel-Cream\' Reveal','video','Addresses the \'Do less, not more\' trend by simplifying the routine to one step that disappears into the skin, countering the \'heavy cream\' perception. [sources: manual_seed.md#4-d05c13434d930170, manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e]','Focuses on the specific product insight that Embun sells better when positioned as a \'gel-cream\' that disappears, using visual proof of texture rather than clinical claims. [sources: products.md#2-1fd832e6cfacf871, brand.md#5-ced846224b2b1279, brand.md#2-0304363243e2d334]',3,'[\"demonstration_method\", \"cast_demographic\", \"text_overlay_style\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-27 03:10:05','2026-08-27 03:10:05'),(22,13,'The Great Unburdening','video','Leverages the TikTok trend of \'do-less\' skincare and the rising #SkinbarrierMY conversation. It reframes \'Merdeka\' (freedom) as liberation from the burden of 10-step routines that fail in Malaysian humidity. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e]','Directly addresses the brand\'s core positioning of \'humidity-first formulation\' and the specific insight that the cream sells better when positioned as a lightweight \'gel-cream\'. It uses the cleanser\'s \'no tightness\' benefit to complete the \'unburdening\' narrative. [sources: products.md#2-1fd832e6cfacf871, brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c, products.md#1-ff70df38bba8b661]',3,'[\"The specific \'heavy\' pain point being liberated from (e.g., sticky sunscreen layer, clogged pores under tudung, makeup sliding off)\", \"The visual demonstration of absorption (e.g., tissue test, water droplet bead-up, time-lapse fade)\", \"The setting of the \'before\' state (e.g., office AC vs outdoor heat, post-commute sweat, evening wind-down)\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 07:27:36','2026-08-28 07:28:00'),(23,13,'RM79 Freedom Bundle','carousel','Capitalizes on Shopee commerce signals showing bundles outperform single SKUs and the high search volume for \'skincare malaysia shopee\'. It uses the \'Merdeka\' sale timing to justify the bundle value without cheapening the brand. [sources: manual_seed.md#2-a97cf75aebd4d962, my-skincare-malaysia.md#1-24c45a37336dd8de]','Focuses on the specific price point (RM79) and the two products included. It avoids clinical claims, sticking to the \'gel-cream\' texture and \'amino-acid\' gentle cleansing facts. It respects the guardrail against acne treatment claims by focusing on \'balance\' and \'comfort\'. [sources: products.md#2-1fd832e6cfacf871, products.md#1-ff70df38bba8b661, campaigns.md#3-b2c3e00cda085e89]',3,'[\"The primary value proposition headline (e.g., \'Price of one premium serum\', \'Two steps, total balance\', \'Humidity-proof duo\')\", \"The visual layout of the products (e.g., flat lay with Merdeka colors, held in hand against urban backdrop, split screen of texture shots)\", \"The call-to-action urgency level (e.g., \'Shopee Exclusive\', \'Limited Merdeka Stock\', \'Free Shipping Highlight\')\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-28 07:27:36','2026-08-28 07:27:36'),(24,13,'Made for Our Heat','video','Taps into the \'buying Malaysian-made\' sentiment peaking during Merdeka, avoiding empty flag-waving by proving *why* local formulation matters (32°C/80% humidity). Uses the \'text-on-screen, no voiceover\' format for cross-language reach. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e, my-skincare-malaysia.md#2-9cd0fba10e097ff4]','Grounds the \'Malaysian-made\' claim in the specific environmental data (32°C, 80% humidity) found in the brand knowledge. It highlights the JAKIM halal certification and NPRA notification as trust signals, differentiating from imported brands that aren\'t formulated for this climate. [sources: brand.md#0-76302cee87b2c58a, brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c]',3,'[\"The specific Malaysian urban setting shown (e.g., KL LRT platform, Penang street food area, JB causeway traffic)\", \"The text-overlay hook (e.g., \'Why your Korean routine fails here\', \'Formulated for 80% humidity\', \'Local skin, local solution\')\", \"The cast demographic focus (e.g., Malay woman with tudung, Chinese woman in office wear, Indian woman in casual attire)\"]','PENDING',NULL,'2026-08-28 07:27:36','2026-08-28 07:27:36'),(25,14,'The Curated Wardrobe','carousel','Draws on the \'Do less, not more\' trend by positioning the 10-set bundle as a complete, simplified solution for varied social calendars, reducing the fatigue of choosing single items while maximizing style options. [sources: manual_seed.md#4-d05c13434d930170]','Aligns with the brand\'s positioning of \'Luxury-inspired nail fashion for at-home self-expression\' and the instruction to position sets through \'occasion and styling mood\'. It avoids technical claims, focusing instead on the aesthetic variety of the curated collection. [sources: brand-profile.md#6-31cbcb735850e93b, brand-profile.md#4-8bbfdbdb7a3cf224]',2,'[\"Occasion Pairing (e.g., Corporate Chic vs. Weekend Brunch)\", \"Color Story Focus (e.g., Nudes & Neutrals vs. Bold Accents)\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 09:02:25','2026-08-28 09:09:14'),(26,14,'The Ritual of Independence','video','Leverages \'Local-made pride\' and the Merdeka period by framing the act of self-styling as a celebration of modern Malaysian women\'s independence and confidence, connecting national pride with personal autonomy in beauty choices. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e]','Uses the \'NailIt Mannequin Kit\' as a key prop to emphasize the \'considered beauty ritual\' and \'guided, self-directed application experience\', ensuring the focus remains on the sensory experience rather than speed or durability claims. [sources: brand-profile.md#3-64701f86905de9d7, brand-profile.md#5-5f27cb60970364d2]',2,'[\"Setting Atmosphere (e.g., Sunlit Morning Quiet vs. Evening City Glow)\", \"Narrative Voiceover Tone (e.g., Introspective Whisper vs. Confident Declaration)\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 09:02:25','2026-08-28 09:09:15'),(27,14,'Editorial Still Life','image','Adopts the \'Text-on-screen product demos\' preference for clean, high-impact visuals that travel across language groups, using a fashion-editorial aesthetic to elevate the perceived value of the press-on sets without needing voiceover explanation. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e]','Reflects the \'Polished, feminine, fashion-editorial\' brand voice by treating the nail sets as high-fashion accessories. It focuses on \'finish and colour story\' as approved claims, presenting the \'Buy 5 Free 5\' as a collector\'s edit rather than a discount bin clearance. [sources: brand-profile.md#3-64701f86905de9d7, brand-profile.md#4-8bbfdbdb7a3cf224]',2,'[\"Composition Style (e.g., Minimalist Flat Lay vs. Artistic Shadow Play)\", \"Prop Styling (e.g., Silk Textiles vs. Modern Architectural Elements)\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 09:02:25','2026-08-28 09:09:16'),(28,15,'The Editorial Close-Up','video','Inspired by the trend signal that text-on-screen product demos without voiceover outperform talking-head explainers in MY, this concept uses silent, high-definition visuals to let the product texture speak for itself, avoiding the \'derivative\' feel of over-produced content. [sources: manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e]','Aligns with the brand voice of being \'concise, sensory and aspirational\' and positions the press-on sets as \'curated premium\' items through finish and colour story, rather than making forbidden long-wear or safety claims. [sources: brand-profile.md#3-64701f86905de9d7, brand-profile.md#4-8bbfdbdb7a3cf224]',2,'[\"Finish focus (Matte vs. Glossy)\", \"Styling mood (Office Chic vs. Evening Glam)\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 09:41:13','2026-08-28 09:41:23'),(29,15,'Ritual Over Routine','carousel','Subverts the mocked \'10-step routine\' trend by framing the application as a singular, mindful \'beauty ritual\' rather than a chore, appealing to the audience\'s desire for \'premium self-care\' and \'content-worthy details\'. [sources: manual_seed.md#5-43e33ed51a2ff6b9]','Directly utilizes the approved claim of supporting an \'at-home application ritual\' and targets the audience who values \'beauty rituals\' and \'convenience\', ensuring no medical or \'instant-application\' claims are made. [sources: brand-profile.md#2-350c5ab17ecc088f, brand-profile.md#6-31cbcb735850e93b]',2,'[\"Setting (Sunday Reset vs. Pre-Event Prep)\", \"Prop styling (Minimalist Tray vs. Floral Accent)\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 09:41:13','2026-08-28 09:41:24'),(30,15,'Curated Gift Edit','image','Capitalizes on the commerce signal that \'bundles beat single SKUs\' and the rising query for \'raya promotion terbaik\' by positioning the 5-item sale as a curated collection for gifting or personal stocking, leveraging trust through curation rather than just price dropping. [sources: manual_seed.md#2-a97cf75aebd4d962]','Reflects the brand\'s positioning of \'luxury-inspired nail fashion\' and the approved claim that sets are \'suitable for gifting\', maintaining a \'quietly confident\' tone that avoids shaming other routines or promising precise wear duration. [sources: brand-profile.md#6-31cbcb735850e93b, brand-profile.md#7-016b66b1940d0913]',2,'[\"Recipient framing (Self-Gift vs. Bestie Bundle)\", \"Visual composition (Flat Lay vs. Hand-Held Portrait)\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 09:41:13','2026-08-28 09:41:25'),(31,16,'The Merdeka Edit: Editorial Still Life','carousel','Draws on the \'Local-made pride\' signal which demands substance over flag-waving, and the preference for \'text-on-screen product demos\' that allow for quiet, visual storytelling without voiceover noise. [sources: manual_seed.md#4-d05c13434d930170, manual_seed.md#1-bf97ca52bdd6e92e]','Aligns with the brand voice of \'fashion-editorial and quietly confident\' and positions the product as \'curated premium press-on nail sets\' suitable for \'occasion styling\'. It focuses on the \'polished nail-fashion look\' rather than technical performance. [sources: brand-profile.md#4-8bbfdbdb7a3cf224, brand-profile.md#3-64701f86905de9d7, brand-profile.md#6-31cbcb735850e93b]',2,'[\"Color Story: Hibiscus Red & Gold vs. Royal Blue & Silver\", \"Styling Prop: Traditional Songket Fabric vs. Modern Minimalist Marble\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 14:18:33','2026-08-28 14:27:02'),(32,16,'Ritual of Independence: The At-Home Salon','video','Leverages the \'Do less, not more\' cross-platform theme, positioning the press-on application as a simplified, honest beauty routine that respects the user\'s time and comfort, contrasting with the \'10-step fatigue\' seen in skincare. [sources: manual_seed.md#4-d05c13434d930170]','Grounded in the core benefit of a \'considered beauty ritual at home\' and the \'disposable self-service manicure mannequin kit\'. It highlights \'easy personal styling\' and avoids forbidden \'instant-application\' or \'salon-equivalent\' claims by focusing on the experience. [sources: brand-profile.md#1-012d483e108749f6, brand-profile.md#4-8bbfdbdb7a3cf224, brand-profile.md#7-016b66b1940d0913]',2,'[\"Setting: Morning Light Bedroom Ritual vs. Evening Vanity Prep\", \"Audio Vibe: Lo-fi Beats vs. Ambient ASMR Sounds\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 14:18:33','2026-08-28 14:27:04'),(33,16,'Curated Collective: The 31% Style Bundle','image','Responds to the commerce signal that \'bundles beat single SKUs\' and the specific brief requirement for a 5-set purchase incentive. It frames the bulk buy as a \'curated aesthetic\' choice rather than just a discount hunt. [sources: manual_seed.md#2-a97cf75aebd4d962]','Targets \'luxury-minded, style-led women\' who value \'curated aesthetics\' and \'gifting\'. It presents the 5-set bundle as a complete wardrobe accessory kit, adhering to the \'approved claims\' of suitability for gifting and occasion styling. [sources: brand-profile.md#2-350c5ab17ecc088f, brand-profile.md#6-31cbcb735850e93b, brand-profile.md#4-8bbfdbdb7a3cf224]',2,'[\"Bundle Composition: Monochromatic Nude Palette vs. Bold Occasion Mix\", \"Visual Layout: Flatlay Grid vs. Hand-Held Fan Display\"]','APPROVED',NULL,'2026-08-28 14:18:33','2026-08-28 14:27:08');
