", \"layout\": \"feature\", \"eyebrow\": \"carousel\", \"headline\": \"Golden Hour Luxury\"}, {\"body\": \"Push the Iphone Sales by introducing the discount in the luxurious way\", \"layout\": \"cta\", \"eyebrow\": \"Next\", \"headline\": \"Shop the private sale on Shopee now\"}]','/media/c94e688c2e5f436e884fef63cb9a8572.mp4','/media/014f7b7fe5e64dca8576ae7428e31616.png',15,5,'passed',NULL,'approved','2026-08-26 10:03:32','2026-08-26 10:03:48',11,0,NULL),(8,'Merdeka 2026 Hot Sales — video','product_marketing','Your brand','Merdeka 2026 Hot Sales','The people this campaign is for.','Shop the private sale on Shopee now','[{\"body\": \"Curated picks, dermatologist-reviewed, at prices that actually make sense. Grab the Kulit Sihat starter bundle before the door closes.\", \"layout\": \"hero\", \"eyebrow\": \"Your brand\", \"headline\": \"Private Sale. Your skin, sorted.\"}, {\"body\": \"Aligns with the brand\'s positioning of offering premium, dermatologist-reviewed products at accessible price points. The \'Private Sale\' angle mirrors the brand\'s strategy of creating urgency through limited-time offers while maintaining a sophisticated tone. [sources: brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c, campaigns.md#0-ac2fa8295ccb2bba, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]\", \"layout\": \"feature\", \"eyebrow\": \"carousel\", \"headline\": \"Private Sale Invitation\"}, {\"body\": \"Reflects the brand\'s understanding that the target audience is price-sensitive but brand-loyal. The \'Art of the Deal\' concept elevates the discount from a mere price cut to a strategic decision, appealing to the audience\'s desire for both quality and value. [sources: brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c, products.md#0-9acf1c4f15ecbab2, campaigns.md#2-7dbaaede50334936]\", \"layout\": \"feature\", \"eyebrow\": \"video\", \"headline\": \"The Art of the Deal\"}, {\"body\": \"Aligns with the brand\'s strategy of creating visually appealing, high-quality content that resonates with the target audience\'s desire for premium experiences. The \'Golden Hour\' aesthetic elevates the iPhone from a tech product to a lifestyle accessory. [sources: brand.md#1-9eae976fa1da0c9c, campaigns.md#0-ac2fa8295ccb2bba, products.md#4-b9423d548dbcfac4]\", \"layout\": \"feature\", \"eyebrow\": \"carousel\", \"headline\": \"Golden Hour Luxury\"}, {\"body\": \"Push the Iphone Sales by introducing the discount in the luxurious way\", \"layout\": \"cta\", \"eyebrow\": \"Next\", \"headline\": \"Shop the private sale on Shopee now\"}]','/media/d8d2b23b392d4c4f9c8722ff6ae90068.mp4','/media/4a7b70a6ae8840bfbc654a1be09289e0.png',15,5,'passed',NULL,'approved','2026-08-26 17:37:53','2026-08-26 17:38:01',11,0,NULL);
