dern Minimalist Marble\' but describes Blue/Silver nails on Marble. It ignores the \'vs\' component entirely.\\n3. Crucially, the variants mix up the axes. Variant 1 uses the Songket prop (from Axis 2) and Variant 2 uses the Blue/Silver color (from Axis 1). This results in two completely different concepts (Red/Songket vs Blue/Marble) rather than a controlled test of specific axes. \\n\\nTo fix this:\\n- If testing Color Story: Keep the prop constant (e.g., Marble) and show Red/Gold in one variant and Blue/Silver in the other.\\n- If testing Styling Prop: Keep the color constant (e.g., Red/Gold) and show Songket in one variant and Marble in the other.\\n\\nAdditionally, Variant 2\'s headline \'Heritage Woven\' contradicts the visual brief of \'Modern Minimalist Marble\' which has no weaving. The copy must match the specific visual it is paired with.\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"agent\": \"system\", \"phase\": \"failed\", \"detail\": \"Revision budget spent after 2 passes — handing the work over flagged\"}, {\"data\": {\"passed\": false, \"revisions\": 2}, \"agent\": \"system\", \"phase\": \"failed\", \"detail\": \"2 variants after 2 revisions — flagged for you\"}, {\"data\": {}, \"agent\": \"system\", \"phase\": \"failed\", \"detail\": \"2 validation errors for CopySet\\nvariants.0.body\\n  Field required [type=missing, input_value={\'hook_type\': \'Setting: M...\'Shop the Morning Edit\'}, input_type=dict]\\n    For further information visit https://errors.pydantic.dev/2.13/v/missing\\nvariants.1.body\\n  Field required [type=missing, input_value={\'hook_type\': \'Audio Vibe... \'Listen to the Ritual\'}, input_type=dict]\\n    For further information visit https://errors.pydantic.dev/2.13/v/missing\"}]',NULL,1,2,2,2,'qwen','2026-08-28 14:35:53','2026-08-28 14:35:53'),(47,16,'Merdeka Luxury Sale','generate','succeeded','2026-08-28 14:36:50',43514,'0 variants across 0 concepts — all passed','[{\"data\": {\"axes\": [\"Setting: Morning Light Bedroom Ritual vs. Evening Vanity Pr