action sits directly beneath it.\", \"composition_notes\": \"[demo] Subject sits left of centre; the eye lands on the face first and the headline occupies the open space above it.\"}','pass',NULL,1,'2026-08-25 04:13:00','2026-08-25 04:13:00'),(12,5,'value framing','[demo] Headline that turns on “value framing”','[demo] Two lines of body copy written so that value framing is the thing setting this variant apart from its siblings.','[demo] Act now — value framing','{\"image_prompt\": \"[demo] Natural-light photograph, Malaysian setting, with clear uncluttered space at top-left for a headline.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"[demo] \\\"[demo] Headline that turns on “value framing”\\\" at top-left; the call to action sits directly beneath it.\", \"composition_notes\": \"[demo] Subject sits left of centre; the eye lands on the face first and the headline occupies the open space above it.\"}','pass',NULL,1,'2026-08-25 04:13:00','2026-08-25 04:13:00'),(13,5,'cta phrasing','[demo] Headline that turns on “cta phrasing”','[demo] Two lines of body copy written so that cta phrasing is the thing setting this variant apart from its siblings.','[demo] Act now — cta phrasing','{\"image_prompt\": \"[demo] Natural-light photograph, Malaysian setting, with clear uncluttered space at bottom-left for a headline.\", \"placement_zone\": \"bottom-left\", \"text_placement\": \"[demo] \\\"[demo] Headline that turns on “cta phrasing”\\\" at bottom-left; the call to action sits directly beneath it.\", \"composition_notes\": \"[demo] Subject sits left of centre; the eye lands on the face first and the headline occupies the open space above it.\"}','pass',NULL,1,'2026-08-25 04:13:00','2026-08-25 04:13:00'),(14,6,'emotional hook','[demo] Headline that turns on “emotional hook”','[demo] Two lines of body copy written so that emotional hook is the thing setting this variant apart from its siblings.','[demo] Act now — emotional hook','{\"image_prompt\": \"[demo] Natural-light photograph, Malaysian setting, with clear uncluttered space at top-left for a headline.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"[demo] \\\"[demo] Headline that turns on “emotional hook”\\\" at top-left; the call to action sits directly beneath it.\", \"composition_notes\": \"[demo] Subject sits left of centre; the eye lands on the face first and the headline occupies the open space above it.\"}','pass',NULL,1,'2026-08-25 04:13:00','2026-08-25 04:13:00'),(15,6,'proof shown','[demo] Headline that turns on “proof shown”','[demo] Two lines of body copy written so that proof shown is the thing setting this variant apart from its siblings.','[demo] Act now — proof shown','{\"image_prompt\": \"[demo] Natural-light photograph, Malaysian setting, with clear uncluttered space at bottom-left for a headline.\", \"placement_zone\": \"bottom-left\", \"text_placement\": \"[demo] \\\"[demo] Headline that turns on “proof shown”\\\" at bottom-left; the call to action sits directly beneath it.\", \"composition_notes\": \"[demo] Subject sits left of centre; the eye lands on the face first and the headline occupies the open space above it.\"}','pass',NULL,1,'2026-08-25 04:13:00','2026-08-25 04:13:00'),(16,6,'cta phrasing','[demo] Headline that turns on “cta phrasing”','[demo] Two lines of body copy written so that cta phrasing is the thing setting this variant apart from its siblings.','[demo] Act now — cta phrasing','{\"image_prompt\": \"[demo] Natural-light photograph, Malaysian setting, with clear uncluttered space at top-center for a headline.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-center\", \"text_placement\": \"[demo] \\\"[demo] Headline that turns on “cta phrasing”\\\" at top-center; the call to action sits directly beneath it.\", \"composition_notes\": \"[demo] Subject sits left of centre; the eye lands on the face first and the headline occupies the open space above it.\"}','pass',NULL,1,'2026-08-25 04:13:00','2026-08-25 04:13:00'),(17,10,'hook','Kulit Berminyak? This Raya Gift Works.','Our Kulit Sihat starter — cleanser and serum — is RM99 on Shopee and it\'s already a complete set. No need to add anything, just wrap and give. Order above RM120 and we\'ll toss in free sampling sachets for extra Raya cheer.','Shop the Raya Set on Shopee','{\"image_prompt\": \"A Malaysian woman in her late 20s with warm olive skin and natural, dewy (not shiny) complexion, wearing a simple emerald green blouse, seated against a soft warm cream background with gentle bokeh. She looks directly at camera with a playful, knowing half-smile and one slightly raised eyebrow — the expression of someone who has the answer to a problem. Cinematic soft key lighting from the left, shallow depth of field focused sharply on her eyes and smile. She is framed from the chest up, positioned in the right half of the frame, leaving the entire left side and lower-left quadrant completely clear and uncluttered. Mood: warm, confident, sisterly.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"Headline \'Kulit Berminyak? This Raya Gift Works.\' sits in the upper-left quadrant above her shoulder line; body copy sits in the lower-left; CTA \'Shop the Raya Set on Shopee\' anchors the bottom-left corner.\", \"composition_notes\": \"Eye lands first on the woman\'s expressive, slightly amused face in the upper right — her raised eyebrow and subtle smile deliver the hook\'s playful challenge. The lower two-thirds of the frame is a clean, softly lit negative space (warm cream wall + subtle bokeh) where the headline and body copy sit comfortably without competing with any facial feature or product element.\"}','flagged','The copy needs work on two fronts. First, the voice is too clinical and lacks the brand\'s mandated warmth, humor, and natural Manglish/BM code-switching. Both variants read like generic marketing copy rather than a \'knowledgeable older sister.\' Second, the variants fail the DIVERSITY test — both are essentially the same idea (problem → solution → gift) with only superficial word changes. The \'hook\' vs \'setting\' axes aren\'t meaningfully differentiated; both could stand in for each other. Rewrite both variants with distinct angles: Variant 1 should lean into the \'hook\' axis with a more provocative, conversational opening (e.g., \'Raya gift for your kulit berminyak bestie?\'). Variant 2 should genuinely shift to the \'setting\' axis by focusing on the office environment and colleague dynamic, not just mentioning a drawer. Use natural code-switching (1-2 instances max), shorter sentences, and the brand\'s plainspoken tone. Avoid clinical phrasing like \'complete set\' or \'no need to add anything\' — make it sound like advice from a friend.',2,'2026-08-26 06:27:49','2026-08-26 06:27:49'),(18,10,'setting','Open the Drawer. Find the Gift.','Picture your colleague opening their desk drawer on the last working day before Raya — and finding the Kulit Sihat starter tucked inside. RM99 for cleanser and serum, free sampling sachets on orders above RM120.','Get It Delivered to the Office','{\"image_prompt\": \"Over-the-shoulder POV in a modern Malaysian office: a Malay woman in her early 30s wearing a soft beige blouse and a simple gold necklace is caught mid-reach into her open desk drawer, her face lit by warm afternoon window light from the right, expression shifting from surprise to a quiet, delighted smile. On the desk surface in the lower right, a neatly wrapped small gift box in matte sage green with a simple cream ribbon sits beside a closed laptop — the box is in soft focus, secondary to her reaction. Shallow depth of field, cinematic warm lighting, muted earthy office tones (beige, soft grey, warm wood). She is positioned in the right third of the frame; the entire left side is clean negative space (blurred office wall and window glow) with no faces, hands, or sharp objects.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"Headline \'Open the Drawer. Find the Gift.\' sits in the upper-left; body copy sits in the mid-left; CTA \'Get It Delivered to the Office\' anchors the bottom-left corner.\", \"composition_notes\": \"Eye is drawn first to the soft, surprised delight on the woman\'s face as she discovers the gift — her expression carries the emotional beat of the copy. The entire left column of the frame (roughly 40% of width) is a clean, out-of-focus office backdrop (blurred monitor edge, soft window light) providing ample negative space for the headline, body, and CTA without any visual competition.\"}','flagged','The copy needs work on two fronts. First, the voice is too clinical and lacks the brand\'s mandated warmth, humor, and natural Manglish/BM code-switching. Both variants read like generic marketing copy rather than a \'knowledgeable older sister.\' Second, the variants fail the DIVERSITY test — both are essentially the same idea (problem → solution → gift) with only superficial word changes. The \'hook\' vs \'setting\' axes aren\'t meaningfully differentiated; both could stand in for each other. Rewrite both variants with distinct angles: Variant 1 should lean into the \'hook\' axis with a more provocative, conversational opening (e.g., \'Raya gift for your kulit berminyak bestie?\'). Variant 2 should genuinely shift to the \'setting\' axis by focusing on the office environment and colleague dynamic, not just mentioning a drawer. Use natural code-switching (1-2 instances max), shorter sentences, and the brand\'s plainspoken tone. Avoid clinical phrasing like \'complete set\' or \'no need to add anything\' — make it sound like advice from a friend.',2,'2026-08-26 06:27:49','2026-08-26 06:27:49'),(19,11,'cast','Why the kakak in the next cubicle still looks fresh at 5pm','She works in 32°C heat and 80% humidity all day. So her kulit berminyak feels less greasy.','Shop the Raya bundle','{\"image_prompt\": \"A Malaysian Malay woman in her early 30s wearing a neat loose-fit blouse, seated at a tidy office desk in a modern KL open-plan workspace. She is positioned on the right third of the frame, looking slightly off-camera with a calm, fresh, composed expression — skin visibly matte yet hydrated, no shine. The left two-thirds of the image is a clean pale cream wall and a light oak desk surface receding softly into shallow depth. Soft, diffused daylight from a large window to the left of frame wraps her face evenly, with no stripe patterns, no harsh shadows. The background behind her is gently blurred into warm neutral tones. Mood: quietly confident, fresh at 5pm, no drama.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"Headline \'Why the kakak in the next cubicle still looks fresh at 5pm\' and body \'She works in 32°C heat and 80% humidity all day. So her kulit berminyak feels less greasy.\' sit stacked on the clean pale wall on the left side of the frame. CTA \'Shop the Raya bundle\' sits on the light oak desk surface in the bottom-left corner.\", \"composition_notes\": \"Eye lands first on the woman\'s calm, composed face in the right third. The left two-thirds is a clean, pale, softly lit wall and desk surface — generous negative space for the headline and body to sit on with strong contrast. The CTA anchors bottom-left over the warm wood of the desk, well separated from the face.\"}','pass',NULL,2,'2026-08-26 06:27:49','2026-08-26 06:27:49'),(20,11,'proof','8 in 10 said less greasy by week 4','Our 120-person Malaysian test panel tried the hydrating serum. Lightweight. Absorbs in 30 seconds.','Read the full review','{\"image_prompt\": \"A single Embun hydrating serum bottle (30ml, minimalist glass with dropper) standing upright on a smooth pale sage-green surface, positioned in the lower-right third of the frame. The bottle catches soft, even studio light with a gentle highlight on the glass. The upper two-thirds of the image is clean, uncluttered negative space — a soft gradient pale sage to off-white background, no objects, no patterns, no diagrams. Lighting is soft and diffused from above-left, giving a clean, trustworthy, clinical-but-warm mood. No harsh shadows. The surface has a subtle matte finish.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"Headline \'8 in 10 said less greasy by week 4\' and body \'Our 120-person Malaysian test panel tried the hydrating serum. Lightweight. Absorbs in 30 seconds.\' sit stacked in the upper-left area of the frame on the clean pale sage background. CTA \'Read the full review\' sits in the bottom-left corner, well separated from the serum bottle in the lower-right.\", \"composition_notes\": \"Eye lands first on the Embun hydrating serum bottle standing tall in the lower-right, catching soft light. The upper two-thirds of the frame is a clean pale sage surface with plenty of negative space for the headline and body. The CTA sits bottom-left, clearly separated from the bottle by the full width of the frame.\"}','pass',NULL,2,'2026-08-26 06:27:49','2026-08-26 06:27:49'),(21,10,'hook','Gift that glows, not greases','Stuck on a Raya gift for your office bestie? Our Kulit Sihat starter (cleanser + serum, RM99) is the no-fuss pick — lightweight, humidity-ready, and *memang* thoughtful. Add free sampling sachets when you hit RM120, and you\'ve got a hamper that says \'I know your skin\' without the stress.','Shop the Raya set on Shopee','{\"image_prompt\": \"A warm, softly lit lifestyle photograph featuring a young Malaysian woman in her mid-20s seated at a minimalist wooden desk. She wears a loose cream linen shirt and subtle gold jewellery, her dark hair loosely tied back. She smiles gently, holding up a small woven rattan tray that displays two skincare bottles: a frosted-glass serum and a white pump-bottle cleanser. The tray also holds a few loose green pandan leaves and a tiny ketupat ornament for festive context. Natural window light from the left creates soft shadows; the background is a blurred open-plan office with hints of fairy lights. The mood is thoughtful, relaxed and premium-casual. Shot in a 4:5 vertical frame, shallow depth of field keeps the products and her expression sharp while the desk surface below the tray falls into gentle blur.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"Headline \'Gift that glows, not greases\' sits in the upper-left quadrant above the model\'s shoulder; body copy wraps beneath it in the same left column. CTA \'Shop the Raya set on Shopee\' is placed bottom-center, resting on the blurred desk surface.\", \"composition_notes\": \"Eye lands first on the model\'s relaxed smile at upper-left, then travels down the soft diagonal of her arm to the product duo nestled in the woven tray at lower-right. The warm beige wall and muted green tray create a calm, uncluttered negative space at top-left where the headline sits, while the bottom-right corner remains free for the CTA button.\"}','pass',NULL,0,'2026-08-26 06:33:18','2026-08-26 06:33:18'),(22,10,'setting','From desk to duit raya','Office gifting sorted: the Kulit Sihat starter (cleanser + serum, RM99) is a sleek, skin-friendly hamper your colleagues will actually use. Formulated for our humidity, it tackles oily-surface, dehydrated-under skin — and with free sampling sachets above RM120, it\'s the Raya gift that keeps giving.','Grab yours on Shopee now','{\"image_prompt\": \"A bright, flat-lay style photograph shot from a 45-degree overhead angle. Two skincare bottles—a frosted-glass serum and a white pump-bottle cleanser—stand side by side on a smooth mint-green surface surrounded by scattered Raya elements: gold confetti, a small green sampin-patterned ribbon, and a few dried bunga telang petals. A pair of manicured hands with minimal jewellery enter from the left and right edges, gently presenting the products as if offering a gift. Soft, even studio lighting eliminates harsh shadows; the background fades to a pale cream gradient. The mood is festive yet clean, modern and giftable. Vertical 4:5 frame with generous empty space at the top and bottom for text overlay.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-center\", \"text_placement\": \"Headline \'From desk to duit raya\' is placed top-center, sitting in the pale cream negative space above the products. Body copy flows beneath the headline in the same central column. CTA \'Grab yours on Shopee now\' is placed bottom-center on the clean mint-green surface below the products.\", \"composition_notes\": \"Eye is drawn first to the sleek product duo centred on the pastel surface, then follows the radiating confetti and ribbon curves outward toward the model\'s hands at the edges. The generous negative space at top-center frames the headline, while the bottom-center strip—free of any object—anchors the CTA.\"}','pass',NULL,0,'2026-08-26 06:33:18','2026-08-26 06:33:18'),(23,11,'cast','Raya prep, tapi kulit tak nak cooperate.','You know that feeling — balik kampung soon, but your kulit berminyak won\'t stop betraying you in the office air-con? Embun hydrating serum absorbs in 30 seconds, so you can glow without the grease. Grab the Raya promotion terbaik before it\'s gone.','Shop Raya bundle now','{\"image_prompt\": \"A Malaysian woman in her late 20s wearing a loose office blouse, sitting at a desk in a modern KL office with tall windows behind her. She touches her T-zone with a slightly frustrated expression, a subtle sheen of oil visible on her forehead under warm afternoon sunlight streaming in from the left. On the desk beside her sits the Embun hydrating serum bottle, softly out of focus. The lighting is natural and warm, with gentle window light creating soft shadows. The composition places the subject on the right two-thirds of the frame, leaving the left third as clean negative space against the pale office wall and curtain.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-left\", \"text_placement\": \"The headline \'Raya prep, tapi kulit tak nak cooperate.\' sits in the upper-left quadrant. The CTA \'Shop Raya bundle now\' sits in the lower-left corner.\", \"composition_notes\": \"The eye lands first on the woman\'s face in the upper third, then travels down to the serum bottle in her hand. The left half of the frame is deliberately left clear — no face, no bottle, just soft office wall and window light — so the headline and CTA can sit cleanly without competing with the subject.\"}','flagged','Variant 1 (cast): The copy is fine, but the assigned axis is \'cast\' and there is only one variant. We cannot judge diversity with only one data point. Variant 2 (proof): The copy is strong and the proof claim is supported by company knowledge. However, the body copy says \'Join the Raya promotion terbaik\' which is slightly awkward phrasing. More importantly, we need a third variant to properly assess the \'cast\' axis variation. Please provide a second \'cast\' variant with a distinctly different cast (e.g., male office worker, older professional, different ethnicity) to demonstrate real variation along the assigned axis.',2,'2026-08-26 06:33:18','2026-08-26 06:33:18'),(24,11,'proof','120 Malaysians tried it. Here\'s what happened.','8 in 10 of our 120-person Malaysian test panel said skin felt less greasy by week 4 — and that\'s in our weather, not some dry winter lab. Join the Raya promotion terbaik and see if you\'re part of the 80%. Stock runs out fast.','Get the Raya deal','{\"image_prompt\": \"A clean, minimalist flat-lay on a pale cream surface: the Embun hydrating serum bottle stands upright at center-right, casting a soft shadow. Scattered around it are a few dried botanical elements — a single pandan leaf, a small piece of bark — suggesting natural formulation without clutter. The lighting is bright, even, and diffused, like a studio softbox from above, with no harsh shadows. The background is a seamless pale beige gradient. The left half and upper third of the frame are completely empty negative space.\", \"placement_zone\": \"top-center\", \"text_placement\": \"The headline \'120 Malaysians tried it. Here\'s what happened.\' sits across the top-center of the fr